@startuml state_stageprogress
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam ArrowColor #444444
skinparam BackgroundColor white
[*] --> InProgress : Begin (panel starts stage)
InProgress --> Submitted : Submit
Submitted --> InReview : OpenReview
InReview --> Approved : Approve
InReview --> ChangesRequested : RequestChanges
ChangesRequested --> InProgress : Resume
Approved --> ChangesRequested : ReopenForRework
Approved --> [*] : next stage may begin (BR-19)
@enduml
